WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:03.680
Another Thing That Doctor Bright Is&nbsp;
Not Allowed To Do At The Foundation:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:10.320
Attempting to disprove 343, to 343. It’s a&nbsp;
horrible idea. Agents are still studying the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:15.040
resulting paperweight, supposedly so heavy&nbsp;
that 343 should not be able to lift it.

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:19.040
For context, while debate around the truth&nbsp;
of this matter rages among Foundation staff&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:23.600
and in our comment sections, SCP-343&nbsp;
is a reality-warping anomaly that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:28.720
refers to itself as God - believed to be&nbsp;
omnipresent, omniscient, and omnipotent.

00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:32.880
A classic thought experiment on the possibility&nbsp;
of this is whether God is capable of creating&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:37.920
an object they themself couldn’t lift -&nbsp;
resulting in a paradox. Or, in this case,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:42.880
an astronomically heavy paperweight that&nbsp;
the SCP Foundation now needs to deal with.&nbsp;

00:00:42.880 --> 00:00:43.840
Thanks, Jack.

